/**
 * Vuxenliv, 1211–1217 (0.29): moving out, studying as an adult, the first job, starting a family,
 * financial responsibility, life choices and priorities, and the changes of middle age.
 * Abstract words are drawn as small symbolic scenes; middle-aged people get grey-streaked hair and
 * older parents white hair, so that the life phase reads at 120 px.
 */
